          <p>
            <strong>            Limits are daily, not lifetime.
</strong>
            Receipts are a daily habit, so your allowance resets on a rolling 24-hour window and there is no lifetime ceiling on what you can earn.
          </p>
          <h3>
            Why a receipt might be declined
          </h3>
          <ul>
            <li>
              The photo is not a receipt, or is too unclear to read.
            </li>
            <li>
              The receipt has already been claimed — each purchase pays once.
            </li>
            <li>
              It is older than 90 days, or above the maximum total.
            </li>
            <li>
              You have already scanned three receipts today.
            </li>
            <li>
              The merchant is not one of the brands we cover yet.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            If something looks wrong, a person reviews it. You can always ask us through Support.
          </p>
