        <section id="bonus">
          <h2>
            Profile bonus
          </h2>
          <p>
            Claiming a username pays a small bonus in stock, on top of your receipt reward. You earn it once you have
            <strong>            both
</strong>
            a username and one approved receipt.
          </p>
          <p>
            The bonus steps down by sign-up order: the first 50 people to qualify get $5, the next 200 get $2, and after that the bonus closes. It is reserved immediately and shows in your app as held, and is delivered after 7 days.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section id="stock">
          <h2>
            What the reward is
          </h2>
          <p>
            A tokenized stock issued by Robinhood Assets (Jersey) Limited. It gives you economic exposure to the share price. It is
            <strong>            not
</strong>
            ownership: no shares, no voting rights, and no claim on the company. Holders are creditors of the Jersey issuer.
          </p>
          <p>
            Launch set:
            <code>            AAPL
</code>
            ,
            <code>            AMZN
</code>
            ,
            <code>            COST
</code>
            ,
            <code>            AMC
</code>
            ,
            <code>            GME
</code>
            . We add brands over time — a receipt from a merchant we do not cover yet cannot be rewarded.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section id="settle">
